abstract: >-
  Self-contained discovery notebook, immutable live-model run archives, exact
  rational certificates, promoted operator arrays, and independent postprocessing
  and verification scripts for verifier-guided search over high-order mimetic
  operator constructions.
keywords:
  - mimetic finite differences
  - large language models
  - summation by parts
  - structure-preserving discretization
  - exact certification
